<urn:product-ontology:assessment-profile:0.4:shape:RealizationContext> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "A version-qualified realization claim needs its realization-to-version binding in the reporting graph." .
<urn:product-ontology:assessment-profile:0.4:shape:RealizationContext> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "PREFIX prod: <urn:productium:specification-profile:>\nPREFIX assess: <urn:product-ontology:assessment-profile:0.4:>\nSELECT $this WHERE {\n $this assess:claimRealization ?r ; assess:claimContext/assess:contextVersion ?v .\n FILTER NOT EXISTS {?r prod:realizesVersion ?v}\n}" .
