<urn:product-ontology:delivery-profile:0.5:shape:ReleaseVersionContext> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "A qualified release status needs an explicit planning link for that version and release; the reverse inference is never made." .
<urn:product-ontology:delivery-profile:0.5:shape:ReleaseVersionContext> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "PREFIX p: <urn:productium:specification-profile:>\nPREFIX a: <urn:product-ontology:assessment-profile:0.4:>\nPREFIX e: <urn:product-ontology:delivery-profile:0.5:>\nSELECT $this WHERE {$this e:releaseStatusVersion ?v . ?release p:reportsStatus $this . FILTER NOT EXISTS {?v p:r83_plannedForRelease ?release}}" .
<urn:product-ontology:delivery-profile:0.5:shape:ResultClaimCoherence> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "A result attribution requires the same explicit claim criterion and context; a realization subject must match the tested realization. Stance remains separately authored." .
<urn:product-ontology:delivery-profile:0.5:shape:ResultClaimCoherence> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "PREFIX p: <urn:productium:specification-profile:>\nPREFIX a: <urn:product-ontology:assessment-profile:0.4:>\nPREFIX e: <urn:product-ontology:delivery-profile:0.5:>\nSELECT $this WHERE {\n $this p:recordsCarrier ?result ; p:recordsClaim ?claim . ?result a p:TestResult .\n FILTER NOT EXISTS {\n  ?result p:recordsExecution ?run . ?run e:executionContext ?ctx ; e:executionCriterion ?criterion ; p:testsRealization ?r .\n  ?claim a:claimContext ?ctx ; a:claimCriterion ?criterion .\n  FILTER NOT EXISTS {?claim a:claimRealization ?subject . FILTER(?subject != ?r)}\n }\n}" .
<urn:product-ontology:delivery-profile:0.5:shape:ResultTime> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "A consolidated result report must not predate the recorded run end." .
<urn:product-ontology:delivery-profile:0.5:shape:ResultTime> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "PREFIX p: <urn:productium:specification-profile:>\nPREFIX a: <urn:product-ontology:assessment-profile:0.4:>\nPREFIX e: <urn:product-ontology:delivery-profile:0.5:>\nSELECT $this WHERE {$this p:recordsExecution ?run ; e:resultRecordedAt ?reported . ?run e:executionEndedAt ?end . FILTER(?reported < ?end)}" .
<urn:product-ontology:delivery-profile:0.5:shape:ReviewTime> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "A review finding cannot predate the referenced binding." .
<urn:product-ontology:delivery-profile:0.5:shape:ReviewTime> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "PREFIX p: <urn:productium:specification-profile:>\nPREFIX a: <urn:product-ontology:assessment-profile:0.4:>\nPREFIX e: <urn:product-ontology:delivery-profile:0.5:>\nSELECT $this WHERE {?ref e:referenceReviewFinding $this ; e:referenceRecordedAt ?created . $this e:reviewRecordedAt ?observed . FILTER(?observed < ?created)}" .
<urn:product-ontology:delivery-profile:0.5:shape:RevisionCycle> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Reference succession must be acyclic." .
<urn:product-ontology:delivery-profile:0.5:shape:RevisionCycle> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "PREFIX p: <urn:productium:specification-profile:>\nPREFIX a: <urn:product-ontology:assessment-profile:0.4:>\nPREFIX e: <urn:product-ontology:delivery-profile:0.5:>\nSELECT $this WHERE {$this e:referenceSupersedes+ $this}" .
<urn:product-ontology:delivery-profile:0.5:shape:RevisionTime> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "A recorded successor cannot predate its predecessor in this reporting profile." .
<urn:product-ontology:delivery-profile:0.5:shape:RevisionTime> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "PREFIX p: <urn:productium:specification-profile:>\nPREFIX a: <urn:product-ontology:assessment-profile:0.4:>\nPREFIX e: <urn:product-ontology:delivery-profile:0.5:>\nSELECT $this WHERE {$this e:referenceSupersedes ?old ; e:referenceRecordedAt ?newTime . ?old e:referenceRecordedAt ?oldTime . FILTER(?newTime < ?oldTime)}" .
<urn:product-ontology:delivery-profile:0.5:shape:RunVersionContext> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "When the execution context is version-qualified, the realization binding must agree." .
<urn:product-ontology:delivery-profile:0.5:shape:RunVersionContext> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "PREFIX p: <urn:productium:specification-profile:>\nPREFIX a: <urn:product-ontology:assessment-profile:0.4:>\nPREFIX e: <urn:product-ontology:delivery-profile:0.5:>\nSELECT $this WHERE {$this p:testsRealization ?r ; e:executionContext/a:contextVersion ?v . FILTER NOT EXISTS {?r p:realizesVersion ?v}}" .
