<urn:product-ontology:semantic-review:0.8:HistoricalEvidenceIndexConstraint> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Every asserted historical carrier-to-claim index pair needs an explicit attribution record. A withdrawn record remains historical evidence of attribution; no truth or current endorsement is inferred." .
<urn:product-ontology:semantic-review:0.8:HistoricalEvidenceIndexConstraint> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "PREFIX p: <urn:productium:specification-profile:> PREFIX a: <urn:product-ontology:assessment-profile:0.4:> SELECT DISTINCT $this WHERE { $this p:recordedAttributionTo ?claim . FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?record a/<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf>* p:EvidenceAttributionRecord ; p:recordsCarrier $this ; p:recordsClaim ?claim . } }" .
