<urn:product-ontology:semantic-review:0.8:ProductContextConstraint> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "A product-level claim with a version-qualified context must name a version of that same product. Unqualified claims remain permitted." .
<urn:product-ontology:semantic-review:0.8:ProductContextConstraint> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "PREFIX p: <urn:productium:specification-profile:> PREFIX a: <urn:product-ontology:assessment-profile:0.4:> SELECT DISTINCT $this WHERE { $this a:claimProduct ?product ; a:claimContext/a:contextVersion ?version . FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?product p:hasVersion ?version . } }" .
